      "markdown": "<!-- slide: 1 -->\n\n- Conditions and native equations\n\n<!-- fig: slide 1, shape 5: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- Use this equation only when x is nonnegative.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 1, shape 2: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n$$\ny = \\frac{x + 1}{2}\n$$\n\n<!-- fig: slide 1, shape 3: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- The numerator includes x plus 1.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 1, shape 4: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n<!-- slide: 2 -->\n\n- Repeated content\n\n<!-- fig: slide 2, shape 5: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- Read each condition before substituting values.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 2, shape 2: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- Read each condition before substituting values.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 2, shape 3: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n$$\nr = \\sqrt{x^{2} + 1}\n$$\n\n<!-- fig: slide 2, shape 4: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n<!-- slide: 3 -->\n\n- Input and output values\n\n<!-- fig: slide 3, shape 4: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n| Case | Input x | Output y |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| A | 1 | 1 |\n| B | 3 | 2 |\n\n- Table 1 records invented values for the same equation.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 3, shape 3: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n<!-- slide: 4 -->\n\n- Merged sample labels\n\n<!-- fig: slide 4, shape 4: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>Sample</td>\n<td>Trial</td>\n<td>Value</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Sample A</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.75</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n- Sample A applies to both trials.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 4, shape 3: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n<!-- slide: 5 -->\n\n- Ordered steps in columns\n\n<!-- fig: slide 5, shape 6: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- 1. Read the condition.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 5, shape 4: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- 2. Choose the equation.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 5, shape 5: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- 3. Substitute the value.\n\n<!-- fig: slide 5, shape 2: unresolved shape geometry -->\n\n- 4. Check the result.\n\n<!-- 